# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @OWNER with the person who owns the
# architecture. A PR that touches one of these paths waits for them; anything else
# merges once its required checks pass and every review conversation is resolved,
# because the architecture it implements was approved in its spec. Turn on "Require
# review from Code Owners" and "Require conversation resolution" for main.

# Work starts, and the architecture is set, here.
/intent/*/intent.md @OWNER
/intent/*/spec.md @OWNER

# The workflows, the scripts they run and the file that names the full check, so a
# build can't change what CI runs, and this file, so a build can't change what waits
# for the owner.
/.github/workflows/ @OWNER
/.github/scripts/ @OWNER
/.claude/checks.json @OWNER
/.github/CODEOWNERS @OWNER
